    ("tax uncertainty", "BrE /ˈtæks ʌnˈsɜːtnti/", "AmE /ˈtæks əˈnsɝtənti/", "税务不确定性", "Tax uncertainty should be disclosed even when the amount is small.", "即便金额不大，税务不确定性也应当披露。"),
